	&copy; {today.getFullYear()} José Alejandro Caal Choc · <a href="https://xacode.dev" class="text-inherit underline-offset-2 hover:underline">XACode</a>
	<SocialIcons class="mt-3 justify-center gap-2" linkClass="text-[#5d6b8c] hover:text-body" />
</footer>
